      },
      "lineNbr": 238,
      "author": {
        "id": 1221725
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-11-15T20:23:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the case of a successful release, I would actually like it to be negative, such that when this method is called again, it throws an exception.\n\nAlso, the only time references are decremented are on cleanupAndRelease, or in releaseIfUnreferencedRecursively (on a child), both of which call releaseIfUnreferencedRecursively immediately",
      "parentUuid": "8de9e7c9_aa1c503d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 236,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 238,
